  "description": {
    "text": "Champions League 2026 Fukuoka was held at Marine Messe Fukuoka on 21 and 22 February 2026, with the master league's qualifying rounds played as a real-time Swiss draw. The top four of each league were invited to the 2026 World Championships. Its top finishers in each league won the Mega Evolution-era print of Victory Symbol in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
